description:
Welcome to Her Presence — a space for women rising.
Hosted by Bianca, spiritual guide and clairvoyant, and Kim, beauty and mindset entrepreneur, this podcast explores spirituality and mindset in real life — the kind that shows up in motherhood, relationships, business, grief, healing, and growth.
We sit with women who’ve walked through the fire and built something powerful from it. We have the conversations most people avoid — in a way that feels grounded, human, and real.
If you’re done shrinking, you’re in the right place.
Don’t forget to subscribe - New episodes bi-weekly.
Connect with us on Instagram: 
@herpresencepodcast
@thespiritualbaddie.co
@graceandbeautyuk
